bluejetty:00163290:android.description:
Boxberry is your parcel delivery service. Our application was created to help you save time and control delivery.
Here you can track online orders, send parcels in Russia and abroad, calculate the cost and delivery time, find a convenient pick-up point and find out about the most profitable promotions.
Order tracking:
❤ without registration by track number or order number;
❤ date of expected arrival of the parcel;
❤ information about the shelf life of the order.
Boxberry delivers orders from 12,000 online stores - plants, cosmetics, children's products and much more. From us you can get goods from Avito, Yula, the Masters Fair and other sites.
Parcel registration:
❤ sending parcels to any of 4600 branches in Russia;
❤ delivery of parcels to Belarus, Kazakhstan, Armenia, Kyrgyzstan, 
Tajikistan and Uzbekistan;
❤ use of your own packaging;
❤ convenient shipment templates;
❤ free packaging for parcels;
❤ choice of delivery method - courier or to the point of issue;
❤ choice of payment for delivery by the sender or recipient.
After the parcel is processed, the application will indicate the cost and delivery time. To send, just give the parcel number to the Boxberry branch operator. Registered users can place parcels in 1 minute.
Benefits for those who send a lot:
❤ parcel templates for quick shipment;
❤ packaging templates;
❤ discounts from 18 to 27% on delivery.
If you send more than three parcels per month, special conditions are available to you - saving money and time.
Search for branches:
❤ map of points for issuing and sending parcels with photos and routes;
❤ always up-to-date addresses and opening hours;
❤ filters by services and payment methods.
Your additional benefits:
❤ promotional codes for delivery;
❤ promotions and special offers;
❤ access to contact center chats in Telegram and Viber.
The Boxberry contact center is open daily from 09:00 to 20:00 (Moscow time).
Registration in the mobile application takes place using a phone number. Register and receive notifications about parcels and orders.
We always hear feedback from our customers! Soon the application will add the possibility of delivery between CIS countries and online payment.

